-- Studio Morgana brand guide: one page. Deep colours, three typefaces, imagery, the wordmark on dark and light.
Let there be a flat canvas called brand-guide, 1600 by 2400.
Let ink be #0b0b10.
Let bone be #efe6d8.
Let brass be #c19a4b.
Make the card ink, grainy 0.12.

-- the cover band
Let there be a rectangle called cover, 1600 by 760, at 800 380.
Print @tiara-night.jpg in the cover, duotone #0b0b10 and #6e1a2e, focused at 0.5 0.3.
Give the cover a vignette of 0.6, in #0b0b10.
Write "Morgana" called wordmark in Bodoni Moda italic, at 120 520, fit 900, aligned left.
Write "BRAND GUIDE · EDITION ONE · 2026" called kicker in Martian Mono, at 124 610, size 26, tracking 6, aligned left.
Write "Deep colour, sharp type, real light." called promise in Jost light, at 124 670, size 40, aligned left.
Make the wordmark bone.
Give the wordmark a shadow, 12 down, blur 30, 50% opacity.
Make the kicker brass.
Make the promise bone, 25% see-through.

-- 01 colour
Write "01  COLOUR" called h-colour in Martian Mono, at 120 880, size 26, tracking 6, aligned left.
Make the h-colour brass.
Let there be 6 rectangles called swatch, 210 by 300, corners 24, in a row, 236 apart, from 225 1060.
Make the first swatch #4a0e1c.
Make the second swatch #0d1033.
Make the third swatch #0f3b2e.
Make the fourth swatch #2b0f2e.
Make the fifth swatch brass.
Make the sixth swatch bone.
Give the swatches an outline in #ffffff, 1 wide, 88% see-through.
Write "Oxblood\n#4A0E1C" called c1 in Jost, at 140 1270, size 24, leading 1.4, aligned left.
Write "Midnight\n#0D1033" called c2 in Jost, at 376 1270, size 24, leading 1.4, aligned left.
Write "Forest\n#0F3B2E" called c3 in Jost, at 612 1270, size 24, leading 1.4, aligned left.
Write "Aubergine\n#2B0F2E" called c4 in Jost, at 848 1270, size 24, leading 1.4, aligned left.
Write "Brass\n#C19A4B" called c5 in Jost, at 1084 1270, size 24, leading 1.4, aligned left.
Write "Bone\n#EFE6D8" called c6 in Jost, at 1320 1270, size 24, leading 1.4, aligned left.
Make the c1, the c2, the c3, the c4, the c5 and the c6 bone.

-- 02 type
Write "02  TYPE" called h-type in Martian Mono, at 120 1420, size 26, tracking 6, aligned left.
Make the h-type brass.
Write "Aa" called aa-display in Bodoni Moda italic, at 120 1600, size 190, aligned left.
Write "Aa" called aa-body in Jost, at 640 1600, size 190, aligned left.
Write "Aa" called aa-mono in Martian Mono, at 1120 1600, size 150, aligned left.
Write "Bodoni Moda\nDisplay · headlines" called t1 in Jost, at 124 1680, size 26, leading 1.4, aligned left.
Write "Jost\nBody · interface" called t2 in Jost, at 644 1680, size 26, leading 1.4, aligned left.
Write "Martian Mono\nCode · labels · data" called t3 in Jost, at 1124 1680, size 26, leading 1.4, aligned left.
Make the aa-display bone.
Make the aa-body bone.
Make the aa-mono brass.
Make the t1, the t2 and the t3 bone, 40% see-through.

-- 03 imagery
Write "03  IMAGERY" called h-image in Martian Mono, at 120 1830, size 26, tracking 6, aligned left.
Make the h-image brass.
Let there be a rectangle called img1, 440 by 380, corners 28, at 340 2070.
Let there be a rectangle called img2, 440 by 380, corners 28, at 800 2070.
Let there be a rectangle called img3, 440 by 380, corners 28, at 1260 2070.
Print @hallows.jpg in the img1, focused at 0.3 0.4.
Print @sienna-shoreline.jpg in the img2, duotone #0d1033 and #efe6d8, focused at 0.5 0.45.
Print @tiara-night.jpg in the img3, grayscale, contrast 1.2, focused at 0.5 0.25.
Give the img1, the img2 and the img3 a shadow, 18 down, blur 40, 60% opacity.

Write "Low light. Warm skin. One colour leads." called rule in Jost, at 120 2330, size 30, aligned left.
Write "studiomorgana.xyz" called url in Martian Mono, at 1480 2330, size 24, aligned right.
Make the rule bone.
Make the url brass.
